 "A defining example of Dogon sculpture, which deeply influenced early modern artists in Paris.",
 "Art with a job to do. It teaches you to judge objects by their power and use, not only by how they look.",
 "The emotional center of the Oceania collection, tied to the history of the wing itself.",
 "Shows how a whole architectural space can be a work of art, and how the Met now commissions directly from living artists.",
 "Byzantine silver at its peak, and a bridge between Roman craft and medieval Christian imagery.",
